    "notes": [
      "Begin each new campaign from the same original digest-bound native save, never a scripted construction fixture or earlier model campaign state. Keep earlier conditions and evidence immutable.",
      "The only model-facing policy addition is native_designations/v1: factual DIG mode, shape and rectangle transaction semantics grounded in the installed adapter. The action schema, parser, execution controls and model-chosen advance_ticks are unchanged. There is no action recommendation, coordinate, build order, material injection or human gameplay rescue.",
      "Relative to the Qwen14 Q3 condition, preserve sampling, quantization for that model, Flash Attention/Q8 cache, context, request and cumulative usage limits and scheduling allowances. The model registry also declares three other exact local models for later matched attempts; declaring them does not mean they have been evaluated under this condition.",
      "The selected reference is included in the actual system-prompt hash and all serialized request-size checks. Packing may omit only older history; current native facts, latest result, persistent notes and corrections remain intact. Existing checkpoints cannot silently acquire new instructions.",
      "Use identical conditions and source saves for matched attempts. One short result per model is not a ranking, sustainability claim or first-year success.",
      "Run one loaded local model and one isolated native runtime at a time with verified teardown. No hosted provider is used. Zero metered model API charges do not imply zero hardware, electricity or existing-host cost."
